      "created_at": "2017-12-21T23:55:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Kickstarted by the end of the year. From an interview i saw, they have the rules all done. They just need to get them into a good layout for people, so this shouldn't devolve into a years long wait like OblivAeon.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I would imagine it will be a few months at the earliest though.</p><p>Edit: not sure why i said that, kickstarted early next year, sorry, my mind is elsewhere right now</p>",
