      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/paul/{size}/5862_2.png",
      "created_at": "2017-12-22T17:18:27.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>We are definitely on track for a Q2 KS for the RPG. Final development, writing, layout/design, etc is all coming along very well! Over the course of crafting the Starter Kit, we discovered and ironed out a lot of the kids of pitfalls that can happen with RPG development. We've also gotten a ton of awesome feedback since the Starter Kit was released, which we are considering and incorporating into the Core Rulebook.</p>",
